                    </a>             </li>
            <li class="nlp-read"><span>2 Min Read</span></li></ul><figure class="nla-cover has-image is-hero"><img width="1024" height="512" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27-1024x512.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="Bar chart of the 10 highest-paid NBA players in 2026-27, led by Stephen Curry on $62.6M, beside his official headshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27-1024x512.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27-300x150.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27-768x384.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27-1536x768.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/10/highest-paid-nba-players-2026-27.jpg 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"></figure><aside class="nlp-take"><h2>Key Takeaways</h2><ul><li>Stephen Curry is the highest-paid player in 2026-27 at $62,587,158.</li><li>Ten players earn more than $56 million, all on maximum-level contracts.</li><li>Maximum salaries are a share of the cap: 25%, 30% or 35% by years of service.</li><li>The average salary across our 521 players is $11.24M and the median is $5.23M.</li><li>A single max salary can use more than a third of a team’s cap room.</li></ul></aside><nav class="nlp-toc" aria-label="Contents"><h2>Contents</h2><ol><li><a href="#the-10-highest-paid-nba-players">The 10 Highest-Paid NBA Players</a></li><li><a href="#why-so-many-salaries-match">Why So Many Salaries Match</a></li><li><a href="#what-a-max-contract-costs-a-team">What a Max Contract Costs a Team</a></li><li><a href="#how-we-track-these-figures">How We Track These Figures</a></li></ol></nav><div class="bde-rich-text-11-102 bde-rich-text breakdance-rich-text-styles"><p>Ten players will earn more than <strong>$56 million</strong> in 2026–27, and every one of them is on a maximum-level contract tied to the salary cap. Here is the full top 10, taken from our <a href="/">NBA salary directory</a>.</p>
<h2 id="the-10-highest-paid-nba-players">The 10 Highest-Paid NBA Players</h2>
